                      	      MEND
|YK0================================================================|YKB

'When ones soul is truly healed the body will follow.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster
Lute Zhu
|YK0
Mend is a basic healing power. A Monk is in harmony with his
body and soul, and is quite capable of restoring his own health.
|CKB
This is an Initiate rank power.
|YK0
================================================================

In addition, Mend is a skill that relates directly to this power.

|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB
                        |GKBSKILL OF MEND
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB

|YKB'Pain must be endured for healing to begin.'|WK0 - |RKBLord Sal Matis
|YK0
Mend is a Monk specific stat. It relates primarily to a Monks
ability to heal both themselves and their allies. The greater
the Mend ability of a Monk, the greater their knowledge of the
healing arts. All Monks gain a rudimentary knowlege of this
skill, but it requires study to take full advantage of it.
|YK0
